### Crear cliente 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "55555555C",
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellidos": "Ruiz",
  "email": "carlos@email.com",
  "telefono": "600555666",
  "nacionalidad": "España",
  "formaPago": "TARJETA"
}

###

### Crear cliente 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "17654321B",
  "nombre": "Elena",
  "apellidos": "Sorolla Fernández",
  "email": "maria.sorolla@email.com",
  "telefono": "600332444",
