###

### Listar todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes

###

### Obtener cliente por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1

###

### Actualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678A",
  "nombre": "Juan Carlos",
  "apellidos": "Pérez García",
  "email": "juancarlos@email.com",
  "telefono": "699888777",
  "nacionalidad": "España",
  "formaPago": "BIZUM"
}

###

### Eliminar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/2

###

### Intentar crear un cliente con DNI duplicado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678A",
  "nombre": "Pedro",
  "apellidos": "Martín",
  "email": "pedro@email.com",
  "telefono": "600999888",
  "nacionalidad": "España",
  "formaPago": "TRANSFERENCIA"
}

###

### Buscar un cliente que no existe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/999